  "youtube_title": "He Finished the Novel... Then It Became Reality | Omniscient Reader",
  "description": "A short, transformative recap/recommendation of Omniscient Reader using limited excerpts from the official WEBTOON episode as visual evidence. Read the official series on WEBTOON.",
  "script": "Imagine finishing a web novel nobody else cared about. Kim Dokja spent years reading Three Ways to Survive the Apocalypse, even while people around him treated it like a weird hobby. Then the final chapter arrives. The author actually messages him, thanks him for reading, and says the story will become paid at seven PM. Dokja thinks it is just a strange goodbye. But the clock hits seven. The train jolts. Everyone panics. And suddenly the fiction he followed for years starts feeling terrifyingly real. This is Omniscient Reader.",
